      "message": "The offset parameter is currently specified in elements of the matrix component type, which may differ from that array element type. Specifically, you can load/store a `i8`/u8` matrix from a `i32`/`u32` array. In this scenario we\u0027d need to adjust either the offset or array count by a factor of 4 to compensate.\n\nThis is likely why the E2E tests are failing on CQ.",
